window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Three possessive alpha cowboys.<br> Three fierce fated mates.<br> One wild ride through Copper Canyon.</i></b></p> <p>Get ready to saddle up and sink your teeth into Copper Canyon Shifters, a steamy paranormal romance series where the shifters are dominant, the danger is real, and destiny never misses its mark.</p> <p>This box set includes three full-length, growly, protective alpha romances:</p> <p>Alpha’s Claim — He’s the Alpha bound by duty. She’s the witch on the run. Together, they’ll ignite a storm no one can outrun.</p> <p>Alpha’s Promise — She ran from betrayal and found something even more dangerous…fate.</p> <p>Alpha’s Vow — They slaughtered her pack. Now she’s hunting them down, until fate delivers a complication she never expected.</p> <p>If you like rough-edged cowboys, protective shifters, feisty heroines, and sizzling chemistry with a side of suspense—welcome to Copper Canyon.</p> <p><i>The mates may be reluctant, but fate never takes no for an answer.</i></p>"; 
